  "scope": "Actual unchanged client dc.a(IZ), dc.o_(), dc.t() and direct source dc.a assignments on genuine completed dc/fd/gr with actual uo/lr/kv/qb. Authored public sleeping-cell input is separately labelled, not bed entry. Shared/replaced input identities, raw float bits, key masks, source null-input and nested null-settings/binding failures. Native-only controls add counted lifetime, RAW/failed phase and counter-limit admission. No actual Minecraft attachment flow, controller, Player/Living/World tick, movement, renderer, network or audio claim."
